  "details": "It would be nice to have the option to create some presets for quickly changing settings without having to go through all of them.\n\nAs example here are some presets I would create:\n\n* Sleep: Turn off notifications, change to \"Head lock\", change status\n\n* Cuddle: \"Head lock\", \"Force near field camera\"\n\n* Better FPS: Higher shield level, lower avatar load distance\n\n* Default: Get back to the usual settings\n\nI think there is a lot of potential in being able to create all kinds of presets.\n\nDefault presets for new users which they could edit or delete would also be possible that way.\n\nBeing able to share them would also be a great bonus.",
